      "content": [
        {
          "type": "thinking",
          "thinking": "The functionality works correctly. Let me also test a few edge cases:\n1. What happens when the OTS proof is confirmed (not pending) - should always pass regardless of --max-pending-hours\n2. What happens when there are multiple range heads with different pending statuses\n\nLet me run a few more tests.",
          "signature": ""
